<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 0.6 pct yr/yr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 0.6 pct yr/yr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 0.6 percent year-on-year in February, while month-on-month it rose 3.1 percent. the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					 Feb 97	Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p>General Index		     105.1	 101.9	 104.4</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	   0.6	   0.7</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	   3.1	   3.6</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	     0.6	   0.7</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>Mining index			 89.8	  73.2	  79.3</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry	  101.7	  96.0	  97.4</p>
<p>Electricity, gas		  122.6	 133.2	 139.8</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
